<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108819" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπομονή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remaining behind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1410a4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>endurance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀκουσίων πόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					240
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Def.</u>
					412c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μὴ ὑ. ἀτιμαζομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APo.</u>
					97b24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1384a21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχερὴς τῆς ἀποτέξεως ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.46
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.51.1
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτου</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς μαχαίρας ὑ. τῶν
			πληγῶν</span> the sword's <i>power to sustain</i> blows, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.15.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in bad
			sense, <i>obstinacy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1012.47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of plants,
				<i>power to endure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.16.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>enduring to do,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχρῶν ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Char.</u>
					6.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
